# Build outputs.
_novo/

# The generated API page.  `novo doc` writes it here so you can read
# what the registry will serve; the registry gets its own copy,
# uploaded beside the archive by `novo pkg publish`.  It is generated
# from the sources, so committing it would be committing a second
# original.
APIDOC.md

# The built package binary.  This package is a LIBRARY and builds none;
# the line is here for when it grows a `main`.
/unicode-nv

# novo.lock is NOT ignored.  `docs/publishing.md` says to commit it, for
# a library as much as for an application: it never ships, and it is
# what makes a build reproducible.  This package declares no
# dependencies, so the toolchain writes none — the absence of the file
# is the empty lock.
